WEBVTT

00:08:54.912 --> 00:09:00.746
on my résumé that might give you pause
about considering me for the position?

00:09:01.246 --> 00:09:05.037
Part of what I think is so clever about
asking that question is even if it

00:09:05.037 --> 00:09:06.871
doesn't get you the job today,

00:09:06.996 --> 00:09:09.204
you learn something potentially
for the next interview.

00:09:09.996 --> 00:09:13.996
That's exactly right. I did learn
from that interview sometimes,

00:09:13.996 --> 00:09:18.912
but I learn it helps me get the job that
is the right job for me here in advance.

00:09:19.329 --> 00:09:22.329
Doesn't mean you have to take it, but
it does mean you can weigh it.

00:09:22.329 --> 00:09:24.662
Sometimes there's a little nugget
in there that will help you.

00:09:25.662 --> 00:09:28.579
This is another form of proactivity
in the face of turbulence,

00:09:28.954 --> 00:09:33.496
seeking feedback by asking what your
limitations are and how you can improve,